🎬  (ComfyUI Workflow)

This project shows a video-to-video identity transfer workflow using:

* Qwen 2.5 Image Edit (2511) → identity replacement
* LTX 2.3 → motion transfer + video regeneration
* IC-LoRA Union Control** → structural consistency (depth + pose + edges)

The result is a pipeline that recreates a video using:

* identity from an image
* motion and performance from a video

