⚙️ Requirements

ComfyUI

Install ComfyUI and create a Python venv (Python 3.11 recommended).

---

Custom Nodes

Clone required nodes:

```bash
cd ~/ai/ComfyUI/custom_nodes

git clone https://github.com/Lightricks/ComfyUI-LTXVideo
git clone https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes
git clone https://github.com/cubiq/ComfyUI_essentials
git clone https://github.com/akatz-ai/ComfyUI-DepthCrafter-Nodes
git clone https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts
git clone https://github.com/evanspearman/ComfyMath
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
for d in \
  ~/ai/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/ComfyUI-LTXVideo \
  ~/ai/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/ComfyUI-KJNodes \
  ~/ai/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/ComfyUI_essentials \
  ~/ai/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/ComfyUI-DepthCrafter-Nodes \
  ~/ai/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/ComfyMath
do
  [ -f "$d/requirements.txt" ] && ~/ai/ComfyUI/venv311/bin/python -m pip install -r "$d/requirements.txt"
done
```

