🧪 How it works (with the example on my video)

Pipeline:

1. Qwen Edit (2511)

   * Replace identity on a reference frame

2. LTX 2.3

   * Uses video as motion guide
   * Uses IC-LoRA (depth/pose/edges) for structure
   * Regenerates full video

3. Output

   * Same motion and performance
   * New identity

---

⚠️ Notes

* This is not traditional face swap
* It is video regeneration with identity conditioning
* Identity can drift in long clips → split videos if needed
* Best results:

  * short clips
  * stable camera
  * clean face reference (cropped)

